OL,3,GNEWSAVicar felt 'really stupid' after
OL,4,Aphone scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeing sent a shiny new phone in the
OL,7,Fpost that you were not expecting may
OL,8,Fsound great, but it could well be a
OL,9,Fsign you have just been scammed.
OL,11,FCriminals might have got into your
OL,12,Faccount, added a new handset to your
OL,13,Fbill, before asking you to "return" it
OL,14,F- to their address.
OL,16,FNearly 30,000 cases like this were
OL,17,Frecorded last year of what a
OL,18,Ftelecommunications boss described as
OL,19,F"at scale, organised crime".
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
