OL,3,GNEWSAVicar felt 'really stupid' after
OL,4,Aphone scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Reverend Jenny Seggar, rector of
OL,7,Fthe Two Rivers Benefice near Ipswich,
OL,8,Ffell victim to this type of fraud last
OL,9,Fyear and told the BBC's Scam Secrets
OL,10,Fpodcast how the "very plausible"
OL,11,Ftechnique unfolded.
